    "Single list of what card data may use (docs/DATA_FORMAT.md). Built from docs/EFFECTS.md. The Python validator (tools/validate_data.py) reads it now; the C# loader reads the same file later.",
    "Parameter types: int, bool, string, amount, effects, cond, enum:a|b, list:<type>, and the named types under 'types'. A trailing '?' marks an optional parameter.",
    "card_kinds: fields a card of that kind may carry beyond the common ones (id, kind, abilities, errata, notes).",
    "Inside a player selector's 'where', conditions are evaluated for the candidate player; 'self' still means the ability's owner."
